459
00:41:30,368 --> 00:41:30,569
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

460
00:41:30,689 --> 00:41:32,990
[SPEAKER_00]: How do I be aware of it, so I'm not affected of it?

461
00:41:34,131 --> 00:41:35,192
