463
00:41:37,914 --> 00:41:39,455
[SPEAKER_02]: It doesn't matter.

464
00:41:42,637 --> 00:41:44,618
[SPEAKER_02]: So, let me just get your question straight.

465
00:41:44,638 --> 00:41:49,540
[SPEAKER_02]: So, how do you be aware of this in the way that you're not affected by it?

466
00:41:49,700 --> 00:41:52,281
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, by the mind that is insulted.

467
00:41:55,902 --> 00:41:59,083
[SPEAKER_00]: Because what you are describing to me sounds like I'm hoping...

468
00:42:00,960 --> 00:42:02,501
