470
00:42:15,169 --> 00:42:17,611
[SPEAKER_00]: They will sort of, maybe, deflate the insult.

471
00:42:17,671 --> 00:42:25,156
[SPEAKER_00]: But the fact is, the people start with an unenlightened mind, with a mind that's not free from greed, aversion, delusion, which means insult will be first.

472
00:42:25,636 --> 00:42:26,817
[SPEAKER_00]: Lust will be first.

473
00:42:27,157 --> 00:42:28,678
[SPEAKER_00]: Aversion will be first.

474
00:42:30,525 --> 00:42:32,627
[SPEAKER_00]: So, how am I not affected in the first place?

475
00:42:32,707 --> 00:42:34,829
[SPEAKER_00]: Not, how will I manage once I'm affected?

476
00:42:37,071 --> 00:42:41,074
[SPEAKER_00]: How will I, whoever affected now, learn to not be affected by this?

477
00:42:44,016 --> 00:42:44,257
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

478
00:42:44,597 --> 00:42:50,101
[SPEAKER_02]: So, first of all, I mean, I'm not really talking about analyzing the sound or something like that.

479
00:42:50,522 --> 00:42:54,305
[SPEAKER_02]: It's just on the level of, like, awareness.

480
00:42:56,206 --> 00:42:56,447
[SPEAKER_02]: But,

481
00:42:58,887 --> 00:43:24,633
[SPEAKER_02]: But if you're... what you're asking is... so, like, if you're already affected, then... first of all, if you're... even if you're already affected, then at least if you have the... if you are aware enough at the... at the point of that, like, if you're aware of, like, being insulted, that the mind... that you're insulted, or that you've... that, like, this... this feeling of... of being insulted is there,

482
00:43:25,757 --> 00:43:31,440
[SPEAKER_02]: Then, at least, you can decide not to speak based on that.

483
00:43:31,480 --> 00:43:31,700
[SPEAKER_02]: Sure.

484
00:43:31,940 --> 00:43:32,580
[SPEAKER_00]: Sense restraint.

485
00:43:32,640 --> 00:43:33,020
[SPEAKER_02]: Okay.

486
00:43:34,321 --> 00:43:41,764
[SPEAKER_02]: So, like, at least, then, if you are aware of that point of being being insulted, then you can decide not to speak based on that.

487
00:43:42,725 --> 00:43:53,669
[SPEAKER_02]: But you have to be aware of, like, of what's going on in your mind, of the, like, feeling of being insulted that is there, in order to then practice restraint or not.

488
00:43:54,730 --> 00:43:55,050
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

489
00:43:55,541 --> 00:44:02,344
[SPEAKER_02]: But you can also, like, I mean, but if you, like, if you understand, first of all, there's many, there's different points.

